%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6a740502731dab025bdeccf416ca83a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: InitialTutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  <ShouldBlockInteraction>k__BackingField: 0
  <ShouldBeSkippable>k__BackingField: 1
  <ChainType>k__BackingField: 1
  <Dialogues>k__BackingField:
  - <Message>k__BackingField: "You gotta look out! Your homemade biscuits are at
      risk because hungry dogs are coming to eat them! You\u2019ve got to build some
      towers to defend your bakery for 10 waves!"
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: "You can spend biscuits on a variety of things, including
      buying new towers. But be careful! Biscuits are also your health - when you
      run out of biscuits, it\u2019s game over! You can see your current biscuit
      count in the top left."
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b691d168a133df34685b6481b536ce4e, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: Use WASD to head over to one of the yellow signs and
      press space to open up the tower options. The gray signs are locations you
      can build a tower if you pay to unlock them first.
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: If you ever need to make more biscuits, you can head
      down to the bakery in the bottom left and hit space.
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b691d168a133df34685b6481b536ce4e, type: 3}
